Tell the runner Pod where each repository is checked out.

The host container gets OMNIGENT_REPO_CHECKOUTS, one line per repository the
session starts with: its variables Secret's name, the repository and its
checkout directory (omnigent_repo_env.checkouts_env). The runner runs a
repository's setup script in that directory and names the repository above its
agent instructions (images/runner/repo-env/). A wake re-renders the Pod
template with the recorded repositories, so it survives a suspend.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f), after 0001-0011.

